testThink←{ ⍝ Phase 4: ID ≡ fixed depth; deterministic cancellation by time 0 and by nodes; 50 ms smoke; exact stop (solver off: threshold 0)
    p←(11 Positions 2)[15×⍳4] ⋄ b←⊃p ⋄ I←⌊/⍬
    id←∧/{(⊃(4,(-##.INF),##.INF)##.Search ⍵)=1⊃I 4 0 0 ##.Think ⍵}¨p
    f←((⊃⍸##.Moves b),(##.Eval b),0 0 2 0)≡0 ##.Think b
    r←I 64 300∘##.Think¨b b ⋄ nd←(≡/r)∧(1 2∊⍨4⊃⊃r)∧(⊃⊃r)∊⍸##.Moves b
    t←⎕AI[2] ⋄ s←50 ##.Think b ⋄ sm←((⎕AI[2]-t)≤100)∧(⊃s)∊⍸##.Moves b
    e←⊃(11 Positions 1)[50] ⋄ x←I 64 0 0 ##.Think e ⋄ ex←(0=4⊃x)∧(2⊃x)=+/~∨⌿e
    id∧f∧nd∧sm∧ex
}
